:: ChildhoodPlay [childhood]
# Games and Learning

<div class="season-indicator season-<<print $environment.season>>">
  <<print $environment.season.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.season.slice(1)>> • 
  <<print $environment.weather.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + $environment.weather.slice(1)>>
</div>

Play is not just for fun - it teaches important skills that you will need as an adult. The games children play mimic hunting, gathering, and other tribal activities.

What would you like to play today?

<<link "Hide and seek in the camp">>
  <<set $skills.perception += 0.2>>
  <<goto "HideAndSeek">>
<</link>>

<<link "Practice with a small toy spear">>
  <<set $skills.hunting += 0.2>>
  <<goto "ToySpear">>
<</link>>

<<link "Play the stone and seed game">>
  <<set $skills.intelligence += 0.2>>
  <<goto "StoneGame">>
<</link>>